~ start
$>  Global.expression = "normal"
if Global.chr_meter <= Global.ONE_HEART:
	=> one_heart

if Global.chr_meter <= Global.TWO_HEARTS:
	=> two_heart

~ one_heart
%
	Christine: hi
	Christine: ...
	Christine: how are you?
	- today's been really tiring
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		Christine: I know right
		Christine: I feel like I'm struggling to keep my eyes open
		Christine: and I got six hours of sleep last night, that's pretty good right?
		- yea, I got around that much too
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
			Christine: yes, you get it!
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
		- six?!
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			Christine: ohh... I guess it is bad...
		Christine: I really wish we could just sleep right now...
		- I mean, we could? 
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: oh, yea, that's true...
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Christine: but no - we have to lock in! 
			Christine: ok, let's keep talking after class
			=> END
		- right, me too 
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			Christine: pfft
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Christine: let's take a nap at lunch then! 
			=> questions
	- good
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		Christine: mhmm
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: that's good [$> Global.expression = "normal"]
		=> questions
% 
	Christine: ...
	Christine: were you able to write down the last slide? 
	- no
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		Christine: me neither
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: miss, can you go back one slide please
		Christine: thank you so much!
		
		- damn, you did that so casually
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: huh, did what?
			- like, 
				Christine: ...
				- asking to go back a slide
					Christine: ...
					- I don't think I could do that haha
						Christine: huh?
						$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
						$> Global.expression = "happy"
						Christine: ohh, do you feel awkward like, asking for help? 
						$> Global.expression = "laugh"
						Christine: you're just like Farah haha!
						$> Global.expression = "happy"
						Christine: don't worry, I'll train you too
						- train me?
							$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
							Christine: like, give you the push to ask questions in class
							Christine: it's what I do with Farah 
							$> Global.expression = "laugh"
							Christine: I got her from asking no questions to asking one like, 30% of the times she needs to
							$> Global.expression = "happy"
							Christine: which is some progress!
							$> Global.expression = "laugh"
							Christine: so yea, I'll help you too haha
						- ok, thanks!
							$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
							Christine: no problem
			- oh nevermind haha... 
				$> Global.expression = "angry"
				$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
				$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
				Christine: ok then...
			
		- thanks
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			Christine: no problem
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: I mean, I needed it too
	- most of it
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		Christine: oh cool! can I write it down from your book
		$> Global.expression = "normal"
		Christine: I missed it... haha
	=> questions
~ two_heart
% 
	$> Global.expression = "angry"
	Christine: hi 
	- you look like a dead whale
		$> Global.expression = "angry"
		Christine: excuse me?
		Christine: ...
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		Christine: ok, that woke me up haha
		Christine: that was so random
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Christine: guess how many hours of sleep I got last night
		- five hours
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
			Christine: nope! four haha
			- I'm not surprised
				$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
				$> Global.expression = "sad"
				Christine: ...
				$> Global.expression = "normal"
				Christine: oh, that's understandable
				$> Global.expression = "sad"
				Christine: I guess you have heard a lot about my... sleep schedule
				: 'schedule' is a bit of a stretch...
				$> Global.expression = "laugh"
				Christine: pfft, it's not that bad! usually...
			- four!?
				$> Global.expression = "happy"
				Christine: I know right!
				$> Global.expression = "laugh"
				Christine: I'm running on pure caffeine right now
		- four hours
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Christine: wow, you're spot on
			Christine: it's really not enough though 
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: so, if I glare at you a certain way, you know why
		- three hours
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: oh... thankfully no
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Christine: I got four hours of sleep
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: so, if I glare at you a certain way, you know why
	- are you good?
		$> Global.expression = "angry"
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		Christine: yea?
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Christine: ok, I might have only got... four hours of sleep
		Christine: anyway, I'm fine though
	- hi
		$> Global.expression = "angry"
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		Christine: hi
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Christine: oh, right, I just said that
	$> Global.expression = "normal"
	Christine: how many hours of sleep did you get?
	- eight actually!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: wow, that's really good!
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		Christine: I should probably follow your example
	- six...
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		Christine: oh, that's me on a good day!
	=> questions
=> END

~ questions
$> Global.expression = "normal"
Christine: ...
- compliment (33% success rate)
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke (50% success rate)
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.chr_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Christine: ... 
$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Christine: you really think so? 
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Christine: thank you! 
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Christine: ...
$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS * 2
$> Global.expression = "angry"
Christine: ??
Christine: now's not time for you to joke around
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Christine: ...
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
Christine: pfft
Christine: that's so stupid haha
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Christine: ...
$> Global.expression = "normal"
$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.chr_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS 
Christine: hmm 
Christine: oh yea...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "normal"
Christine: ok, let's lock in now!
=> END